{"unit_id":"rakibulrocky14__dsh-cli#card-zh","repo":"rakibulrocky14/dsh-cli","commit":"eadec0879d6b358d2df1cb3e76202c8319b7caa9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-terminal 为 DSH 提供终端交互界面，适合希望在命令行使用 coding agent 的用户。它作为 Cordis surface 接入 dsh-base，复用已有 agent、工具、会话和插件。启动时可进入全屏 TUI；非交互环境使用行式 REPL，也可用 --print 执行单次任务并输出结果。用户能浏览或恢复会话、创建会话、切换模型与推理强度、选择 agent 预设，并查看工具、插件、设置和权限。需要本机安装 DSH CLI 与兼容的 Node.js；插件未声明额外 API key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:16-23","lib/index.js:39-66","lib/startup.js:39-60","lib/core/commands.js:10-35"]}
{"unit_id":"rakibulrocky14__dsh-cli#card-en","repo":"rakibulrocky14/dsh-cli","commit":"eadec0879d6b358d2df1cb3e76202c8319b7caa9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-terminal brings DSH agents to the terminal. It reuses dsh-base services and offers a full-screen TUI, a line REPL, or one-shot task output. Users can resume sessions, switch models, choose presets, and inspect tools and settings. Requires DSH CLI and compatible Node.js.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:16-23","lib/index.js:39-66","lib/startup.js:39-60","lib/core/commands.js:10-35"]}
